---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Base
  title="Anvil Landing · 港区地形 v2 · Verlintas 的小窝"
  description="Anvil Landing v2: an authored Blender/Kitbash3D port district on a 1 km coastal terrain tile with a 60 × 60 m TLOF, real-time Three.js preview, and reference renders."
  panic={false}
>
  <style is:global>
    .terrain-sample {
      --terrain-gutter: max(20px, calc((100vw - 1120px) / 2 + 20px));
      --terrain-panel-bg: rgba(6, 12, 16, 0.68);
      --terrain-panel-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      --terrain-panel-text: #e9eff3;
      --terrain-panel-dim: #9fb1ba;
      --terrain-panel-faint: #70838d;
      --terrain-warm: #e9b16d;
      --terrain-sea: #74d9ca;
    }

    .terrain-stage {
      position: relative;
      width: 100vw;
      height: clamp(580px, calc(100vh - 96px), 960px);
      margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
      overflow: hidden;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #0a1218;
      isolation: isolate;
    }

    .terrain-stage::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 3;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(4, 8, 12, 0.22) 0%, transparent 14%, transparent 74%, rgba(4, 8, 12, 0.2) 100%),
        radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 40%, transparent 58%, rgba(2, 7, 10, 0.35) 100%);
    }

    #terrain-canvas {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      outline: none;
      touch-action: none;
    }

    #terrain-canvas:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--sea);
      outline-offset: -3px;
    }

    /* ── panels ─────────────────────────────── */

    .terrain-panel {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 5;
      color: var(--terrain-panel-text);
      background: var(--terrain-panel-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--terrain-panel-border);
      border-radius: 3px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(1.1);
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .terrain-title-panel {
      top: clamp(16px, 3vh, 28px);
      left: var(--terrain-gutter);
      max-width: min(370px, calc(100vw - 40px));
      padding: 13px 15px 12px;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--terrain-warm);
    }

    .terrain-eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 7px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 9.5px;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--terrain-warm);
    }

    .terrain-title-panel h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 30px);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: #f2f4f3;
    }

    .terrain-sub {
      margin: 7px 0 0;
      max-width: 38ch;
      color: var(--terrain-panel-dim);
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .terrain-stats {
      margin: 11px 0 0;
      padding-top: 9px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--terrain-panel-faint);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .terrain-scale-panel {
      top: clamp(16px, 3vh, 28px);
      right: var(--terrain-gutter);
      width: 230px;
      padding: 11px 13px 10px;
    }

    .terrain-scale-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .terrain-scale-list > div {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .terrain-scale-list > div:last-child {
      padding-bottom: 0;
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .terrain-scale-list dt {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      color: #f0dfb4;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .terrain-scale-list dd {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--terrain-panel-dim);
      font-size: 9.5px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .terrain-legend {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      margin-top: 11px;
      padding-top: 9px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 8.5px;
      color: var(--terrain-panel-faint);
    }

    .terrain-legend i {
      flex: 1;
      height: 5px;
      display: block;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8a7957, #5f704d 38%, #979282 66%, #5b584e 84%, #dde4df);
    }

    .terrain-controls {
      left: var(--terrain-gutter);
      bottom: clamp(16px, 3vh, 26px);
      max-width: min(700px, calc(100vw - 40px));
      padding: 10px 12px 11px;
    }

    .terrain-modes {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 9.5px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--terrain-panel-faint);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .terrain-mode-dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--terrain-sea);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(116, 217, 202, 0.8);
    }

    .is-walking .terrain-mode-dot {
      background: var(--terrain-warm);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(233, 177, 109, 0.85);
    }

    #terrain-mode {
      color: #cfdbdf;
    }

    .terrain-sep {
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .terrain-buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 5px;
      margin-top: 9px;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .terrain-buttons button {
      appearance: none;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      border-radius: 2px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
      color: var(--terrain-panel-dim);
      font: 10px/1.2 var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s;
    }

    .terrain-buttons button:hover {
      color: #fff;
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.36);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    }

    .terrain-buttons button.is-active {
      color: #f2e3c5;
      border-color: rgba(233, 177, 109, 0.66);
      background: rgba(233, 177, 109, 0.13);
    }

    .terrain-hint {
      margin: 9px 0 0;
      padding-top: 8px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 9.5px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--terrain-warm);
    }

    .terrain-note {
      position: absolute;
      right: var(--terrain-gutter);
      bottom: clamp(17px, 3vh, 27px);
      z-index: 5;
      max-width: 310px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 8.5px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: rgba(226, 236, 239, 0.5);
      text-align: right;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* ── world labels ───────────────────────── */

    .terrain-labels {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 4;
      pointer-events: none;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .world-label {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      padding: 3px 6px 3px 7px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      border-left: 2px solid var(--terrain-warm);
      background: rgba(4, 10, 13, 0.7);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      white-space: nowrap;
      will-change: transform;
    }

    .world-label strong {
      display: block;
      font: 600 8.5px/1.2 var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      color: #f0dfb4;
    }

    .world-label span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 1px;
      font: 8px/1.25 var(--mono);
      color: #aebfc7;
    }

    .world-label--accent {
      border-left-color: var(--terrain-sea);
    }

    .world-label--accent strong {
      color: #89e4d7;
    }

    .world-label--warm {
      border-left-color: #ef8f5a;
    }

    .world-label--warm strong {
      color: #ffa574;
    }

    /* ── walk mode ──────────────────────────── */

    .walk-crosshair {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      z-index: 6;
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .walk-crosshair::before,
    .walk-crosshair::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      background: rgba(255, 241, 216, 0.86);
      box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    }

    .walk-crosshair::before {
      left: 11px;
      top: 3px;
      width: 2px;
      height: 18px;
    }

    .walk-crosshair::after {
      top: 11px;
      left: 3px;
      height: 2px;
      width: 18px;
    }

    .is-walking .terrain-title-panel,
    .is-walking .terrain-note {
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    /* ── loading / error ────────────────────── */

    .terrain-loading {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 8;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: #081016;
      color: #dce6e9;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      transition: opacity 0.6s ease;
    }

    .terrain-loading.is-done {
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .terrain-loading-inner {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      justify-items: center;
    }

    .terrain-loading-bar {
      width: 180px;
      height: 2px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .terrain-loading-bar i {
      display: block;
      width: 45%;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--terrain-warm);
      animation: terrain-load 1.1s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes terrain-load {
      0% {
        transform: translateX(-110%);
      }
      100% {
        transform: translateX(230%);
      }
    }

    .terrain-error {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 50%;
      z-index: 9;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      max-width: 420px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(224, 122, 102, 0.6);
      background: rgba(20, 8, 8, 0.9);
      color: #f0b0a4;
      font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono);
    }

    /* ── page footer notes ──────────────────── */

    .terrain-explainer {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 22px 0 0;
    }

    .terrain-card {
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .terrain-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 7px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--brass);
    }

    .terrain-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .terrain-card code {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 9px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface-2);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 10.5px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .terrain-card a {
      color: var(--sea);
      border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sea) 45%, transparent);
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .terrain-scale-panel {
        width: 216px;
        padding: 11px 12px;
      }

      .terrain-scale-list dt {
        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .terrain-note {
        display: none;
      }

      .terrain-explainer {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .terrain-stage {
        height: clamp(520px, calc(100vh - 80px), 760px);
      }

      .terrain-title-panel {
        padding: 12px 14px 11px;
        max-width: calc(100vw - 32px);
      }

      .terrain-title-panel h1 {
        font-size: 26px;
      }

      .terrain-sub {
        display: none;
      }

      .terrain-scale-panel {
        top: auto;
        right: 16px;
        bottom: 130px;
        width: 192px;
        padding: 9px 10px;
        background: rgba(6, 12, 16, 0.82);
      }

      .terrain-scale-list {
        gap: 3px;
      }

      .terrain-scale-list > div {
        padding-bottom: 3px;
      }

      .terrain-scale-list dt {
        font-size: 9.5px;
      }

      .terrain-scale-list dd {
        font-size: 9px;
      }

      .terrain-legend {
        display: none;
      }

      .terrain-controls {
        left: 16px;
        right: 16px;
        bottom: 14px;
        max-width: none;
        padding: 8px 10px 9px;
      }

      .terrain-buttons button {
        padding: 5px 7px;
        font-size: 9.5px;
      }

      .terrain-hint {
        font-size: 9px;
      }

      .world-label span {
        display: none;
      }

      .world-label {
        padding: 3px 5px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .terrain-loading-bar i {
        animation: none;
        width: 100%;
      }
    }

    .terrain-compare-block,
    .terrain-gallery-block {
      margin: 34px 0 0;
    }

    .terrain-compare-head {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .terrain-compare-head h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 30px);
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .terrain-compare-head p:not(.terrain-eyebrow) {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .terrain-compare,
    .terrain-gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .terrain-gallery {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .terrain-compare figure,
    .terrain-gallery figure {
      margin: 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .terrain-compare img,
    .terrain-gallery img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      object-fit: cover;
      background: #0a1115;
    }

    .terrain-compare figcaption,
    .terrain-gallery figcaption {
      padding: 9px 11px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 9px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .terrain-gallery {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .terrain-compare {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

  </style>

  <section class="terrain-sample">
    <div class="terrain-stage" id="terrain-stage">
      <canvas
        id="terrain-canvas"
        tabindex="0"
        aria-label="Anvil Landing 1 公里地形样本：港区平台、60 米起降坪、A-30 舰船与 1.8 米玩家胶囊"
      ></canvas>

      <div class="terrain-labels" id="terrain-labels" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="walk-crosshair" id="walk-crosshair" hidden aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="terrain-panel terrain-title-panel">
        <p class="terrain-eyebrow">Authored terrain · Kitbash3D pass</p>
        <h1>Anvil Landing</h1>
        <p class="terrain-sub">1 km 海岸高地 · 420 × 260 m 港区 · A-30 验证场</p>
        <p class="terrain-stats" id="terrain-stats">正在读取 1025² 高程与港区 GLB…</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="terrain-panel terrain-scale-panel" aria-label="样本尺度">
        <p class="terrain-eyebrow">真实尺度 / Scale</p>
        <dl class="terrain-scale-list">
          <div><dt>1 km</dt><dd>地形瓦片 · 1025² R16</dd></div>
          <div><dt>420 × 260 m</dt><dd>港区平台</dd></div>
          <div><dt>60 × 60 m</dt><dd>TLOF 起降坪</dd></div>
          <div><dt>1.8 m</dt><dd>控制器角色</dd></div>
          <div><dt>25 m</dt><dd>A-30 舰体</dd></div>
          <div><dt>12 · 550</dt><dd>K039 模块 · 植被</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div class="terrain-legend" aria-hidden="true">
          <span id="terrain-min-height">17 m</span>
          <i></i>
          <span id="terrain-max-height">151 m</span>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="terrain-panel terrain-controls">
        <div class="terrain-modes">
          <span class="terrain-mode-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span id="terrain-mode">轨道 / Orbit</span>
          <span class="terrain-sep">·</span>
          <span id="walk-coords">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 右键平移</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terrain-buttons">
          <button type="button" data-terrain-preset="port" class="is-active">港区</button>
          <button type="button" data-terrain-preset="pad">起降坪</button>
          <button type="button" data-terrain-preset="vista">海岸</button>
          <button type="button" id="walk-toggle" aria-pressed="false">步行 V</button>
          <button type="button" id="label-toggle" aria-pressed="true">标签 L</button>
        </div>
        <p class="terrain-hint" id="walk-hint" hidden>
          点击画面锁定鼠标 · WASD 移动 · Shift 加速 · Esc 释放鼠标
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="terrain-note">
        SEED 20261116 · R16 1025² → 513² NEAR MESH<br />
        BLENDER 5.3 EEVEE · KITBASH3D K039 · POLY HAVEN CC0 SKY<br />
        REFERENCE RENDERS IN docs/ · REAL-TIME PREVIEW v2
      </p>

      <div class="terrain-loading" id="terrain-loading">
        <div class="terrain-loading-inner">
          <span data-loading-label>LOADING ANVIL LANDING</span>
          <span class="terrain-loading-bar"><i></i></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="terrain-error" id="terrain-error" hidden></div>
    </div>

    <div class="terrain-explainer">
      <article class="terrain-card">
        <h2>01 · Blender / Kitbash3D</h2>
        <p>
          港区不再用程序化方块拼。航站楼、机库、塔台、雷达、燃料罐、龙门吊与集装箱来自
          本地购买的 Kitbash3D K039 Sci-Fi Industrial 套件，在 Blender 中重新布景、
          统一 PBR 材质，并加入 A-30 与两人姿态角色。实时版由这套场景导出、减面并压缩为
          17.6 MB GLB。
        </p>
        <code>Blender -b --python tools/blender/build_scene.py</code>
      </article>

      <article class="terrain-card">
        <h2>02 · 1 km 地形</h2>
        <p>
          1025 × 1025 R16 高程（1 m 采样）由固定种子的 FBM + ridged noise、液滴侵蚀、
          峡谷与海岸雕刻组成。运行时只解码二进制高程，并用 splat / AO / normal 贴图在
          513 × 513 近景网格上混合草地、泥土、岩石与沙地。
        </p>
        <code>python3 tools/terrain/generate_sample.py</code>
      </article>

      <article class="terrain-card">
        <h2>03 · 操作与质量</h2>
        <p>
          左键拖动旋转，滚轮缩放，右键平移；<kbd>V</kbd> 步行（WASD + 鼠标，Shift 加速），
          <kbd>L</kbd> 世界标签，<kbd>R</kbd> 回到港区。参考截图由 Blender EEVEE
          1920 × 1080 / 128 samples 渲染；实时版是 Three.js 预览，角色使用轻量 1.8 m
          替身，完整角色见下方参考图。
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:9px">
          <a href="#reference">参考渲染 →</a> · <a href={`${base}/kitbash-port/`}>Kitbash3D hero 预览 →</a> · <a href={`${base}/`}>← 返回夜航</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="terrain-compare-block" aria-label="Before and after">
      <div class="terrain-compare-head">
        <p class="terrain-eyebrow">Quality pass · before / after</p>
        <h2>从原型 blockout 到可玩的港区</h2>
        <p>
          旧版是 257² 高程、顶点色地形和程序化方块。v2 用 Blender 中的 Kitbash3D
          建筑、PBR 材质、HDRI 日落与长阴影重做港区；地形升级为 1025² R16，并导出
          splat / AO / normal 地图。实时预览保留了尺度、镜头与操作，参考渲染展示质量目标。
        </p>
      </div>
